1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:02,560
- I gotta to work. I'll walk down with you.
- Wait.

2
00:00:02,731 --> 00:00:05,941
(Sheldon:)Uh, which is closer
to the new train store in Monrovia?

3
00:00:06,109 --> 00:00:08,199
The movie theater
or The Cheesecake Factory?

4
00:00:08,862 --> 00:00:10,322
(Howard:)Neither of them are close.

5
00:00:10,489 --> 00:00:13,159
(Sheldon:)I guess it doesn't matter
which one of you drives me.

6
00:00:13,325 --> 00:00:16,415
(Sheldon:)Let's play a fun guessing game
to see who gets to take me.

7
00:00:16,578 --> 00:00:21,288
(Sheldon:)All right. This four-letter word
describes either a printer's type size...

8
00:00:21,458 --> 00:00:23,628
(Sheldon:)...or a compulsion to eat dirt.

9
00:00:24,419 --> 00:00:28,509
- Okay, I'm not driving him.
- Penny, don't give up, you can get this.

10
00:00:32,052 --> 00:00:33,592
(Leonard:)Aren't you going with Sheldon?

11
00:00:33,762 --> 00:00:37,762
(Amy:)No, I have no interest in model trains,
stores that sell them...

12
00:00:37,933 --> 00:00:40,473
(Amy:)...nor their heart-breaking clientele.

13
00:00:41,353 --> 00:00:45,023
(Leonard:)Oh, well, I have some work to do,
so...

14
00:00:45,357 --> 00:00:48,067
(Amy:)I can't imagine that would disturb me.
Carry on.

15
00:00:49,486 --> 00:00:53,576
(Leonard:)Okay. Wouldn't you be
more comfortable at home?

16
00:00:57,577 --> 00:00:59,747
(Amy:)Not really, no.

17
00:01:01,123 --> 00:01:04,253
Alrighty then.
I guess I'll just get started.

18
00:01:04,417 --> 00:01:09,027
(Amy:)Please, I don't need
the running commentary.

